  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AsFE4T9FbN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/luWUDcU.png\" alt=\"如有問題請在Discord留言\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dNN9AT4W75FD5S\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gxtfQds.png\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8ndKits.png\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/Vsaw6BJ.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"245\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8ndKits.png\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/3DD4Udv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"222\" height=\"40\"></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9990\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/trXUtrT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"42\" height=\"24\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9971\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/HY4nys2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9776\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zmDeGXO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"43\" height=\"24\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9550\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/f4ftbOl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"43\" height=\"24\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9366\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bcfGV52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"43\" height=\"24\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9259\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cVR4nMN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"42\" height=\"24\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9186\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mpRSLIH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9008\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Mrq8sjJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"43\" height=\"24\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8ndKits.png\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Just Leveling 是一款靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reskillable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reskillable 模組</a> 的 RPG 模組，現在你擁有被動技能與主動技能，被動技能可從等級 0 升級到 10，主動技能則可根據所需等級啟用或禁用。如同 Reskillable，物品也設有需求條件，最後，稱號也有其需求條件，你可以將它顯示在你的名牌上。發掘所有技能，並試著解鎖所有稱號吧！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">想了解被動技能/主動技能/稱號，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Leveling/wiki/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">新增與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterCombat</a> 的相容性：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">新增與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a> 的相容性：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1sm58Vc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8ndKits.png\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cOWQghI.gif\" width=\"412\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/TkSjYie.gif\" width=\"412\" height=\"233\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/SAFKa6h.png\" width=\"412\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/w5u3rgN.gif\" width=\"412\" height=\"233\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/J0FQSK3.png\" width=\"412\" height=\"234\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/AX5Xe1D.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"233\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8ndKits.png\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：我可以將 Just Leveling 加入我的模組包嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：當然可以，只要在相關專案中註明我的模組即可。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：我可以新增更多技能/稱號嗎？</strong><br>答：可以，請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Leveling/wiki/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> 了解如何新增。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何開啟升級畫面？</strong><br>答：按 Y 鍵即可，你可以在那裡查看技能並更換你的稱號。</span></p>",
